# Purpose
Explains how to keep simple change logs with clear categories, outcomes, and
consistent dates.

# Key Sections
- When to use this guide.
- Keep the purpose simple.
- Use clear categories.
- Write changes as outcomes.
- Include dates consistently.

# Dependencies
- Belongs to the productivity manual set.

# Gotchas
- Change logs should describe what changed, not expose private review notes or
  internal-only implementation details.

# Change History
- 2026-08-03: Added ACE companion.
